<title>USA: TABLE - Talley Q2 results.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Talley Q2 results.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>				  Quarter Ended     Six Months Ended</p>
<p>				     June 30,	     June 30,</p>
<p>				  1997	  1996    1997	1996</p>
<p> Revenue (A)		$87,855    $93,970 $176,186  $189,097</p>
<p>Earnings (loss) before</p>
<p>income taxes and</p>
